# Margins and Spacing

**Always use appropriate margins** for consistent spacing. Do NOT use `gap`.

## Quick Reference

| Context | Class |
|---------|-------|
| Between form fields | `mb-4` |
| Before action buttons | `mt-4` |
| **Between grouped buttons** | **`mr-2`** on first button |
| **Between chips** | **`mr-2 mb-2`** on each chip |

## Button Rule (MANDATORY)

Add `class="mr-2"` to the first/left button in any button group.

```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<v-btn class="mr-2">Cancel</v-btn>
<v-btn color="primary">Save</v-btn>

<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<v-btn>Cancel</v-btn>
<v-btn>Save</v-btn>
```
